      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "似乎并没有发生“连星”呢。\r\n——无论是矮行星，还是小行星。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fcff80764fe240f758890af3202dd2cacd4ca72d5f78f4ad13ec3ce16643144",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
