    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36b7e814804dc5108fde3758",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果是真的会“消失”的话，若是能知道在那瞬\r\n间发生了什么倒还好说……\r\n但新宇宙却看不见那个瞬间……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdceb4576b83d4ca1a7cc296268e469cbf8770d0058fc3b7340270ea19869c39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
