    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3afca85396192c46a7efca1c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "按照新宇宙的话来说，她在『天皇赏（春）』会\r\n以第十名的成绩惨败。换句话说——\r\n至少，她完成了比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2eb690328442fe24153deb698d791a4e3dde0aa7dd25cfc4983fdf185684c203",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
