      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——谜团愈加扑朔迷离。\r\n而且即使暂时不讨论新宇宙本人，\r\n放眼整个比赛界的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "60836b8ea5c027c89df9447c90c2a6f1d310bb2a110f543367ee99c123a7b54c",
