    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a76ded520d9ffe99432f09c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只有新宇宙。只有自己，\r\n新宇宙无论如何都观测不到。\r\n其原因大概就是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "161fa947a8342f23821b825cfbdc95eba0cb850aae2fa12f126105b39a628f8f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105206.json",
      "json_path": [
