    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0bdd8c85165b2d1568f79af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也许正如荒漠英雄所说，\r\n因为观测的窗口被蒙上了一层雾，这才让新宇宙\r\n观测不到其他宇宙中仍然存在的她自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "771f8121f984210e3ea34832e6f12c53f5eaeb4de146580c9bd3f0e8a5b81bb4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09b5abdd11bf0ae8068bf7da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而这种情况下，那“观测的窗口”应该是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf965a7d2077e7a26cad2b687a24007ec1f74dcd133df691f30882a3117e9d52",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
