    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94976ba6fda47a021bc2d7cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是——为什么？\r\n为什么新宇宙的眼睛，仅仅是看不见新宇宙自己\r\n而已？",
      "source_fingerprint": "30cf794dec19ed9d9b1c2c1c7c866ba40bd094c88c91388187167ace5e53aadb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105206.json",
      "json_path": [
