      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙久违地，单纯以“胜利”为目标参赛。\r\n而在她身后，一定也有着谁在支持着她……",
      "source_fingerprint": "433179ad3568204590ed4ae1add33a87045e84c94bbf50e8cf467c5fea91337b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f3e7fe5e85066328eae2c7e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样想的话……在其他宇宙，\r\n大概也有着与“我”相似的存在吧。\r\n那个人，也怀着与我相仿的感情……",
      "source_fingerprint": "830e06810ec58f6bcef09c3de0c0656a275cd925eee760cce1b5b206bc67a31f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7494f90fcecf44a47677b028",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样的想法流遍全身。\r\n新宇宙每日都感受着这样的感觉吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "247c16297b4149eea6f2634a3e272d1a5c8331986ffbfa2de31f8f4a79702469",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5de3f8bb3e6997bae3f54b7e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽我还不能有个清楚的认知，但是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd6d77e767ddb2a0d814eae640c19afa38a57b4c6291242b5c42f6e2ac112107",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97e100b0ffa6c1cac4820cb1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我仍然感觉到了。在某个宇宙之中，\r\n也存在着与我们目标一致的“意志”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f127a2b98136522b9b9be267dbc54f75b37ac12b2483d24c436d23438b32cee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105206.json",
      "json_path": [
