    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d92260f70f018788a3de9014",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“消失”的时刻——正在步步逼近。\r\n但我无论如何，都想象不出一个活人要怎样才会\r\n突然地消失……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8359302b811b8c96dcbc4820f1a2b6d40ad7e6db28c752e7f6e41243f4430a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
