    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbca1598d4747af5435539b6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以这一天为界，今后发生的一切将会决定新宇宙\r\n的命运。\r\n这样想着，我进行着赛前准备。但此时——",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c8db040dc6fed56520c37de303b6797a39b9aac6d1eed3ecbc7d2b0718bd799",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105207.json",
